//tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tamagotchi30thAnniversary_ArtBanner.png","caption":"Баннер к 30-летию Tamagotchi"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:G3385415.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e8/G3385415.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181019122016","caption":"Из альбома «Ura Mametchi» · № 17","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e8/G3385415.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181019122016"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Jc12.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bc/Jc12.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181019122307","caption":"Маг Ура Маметчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bc/Jc12.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181019122307"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:G3385432.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/12/G3385432.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181019125355","caption":"Ура Маметчи Дэнди Сава Кавадей","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/12/G3385432.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181019125355"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Akiiro90.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/46/Akiiro90.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181022145139","caption":"Из альбома «Ura Mametchi» · № 20","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/46/Akiiro90.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181022145139"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:UraMametchiGagCartoonist.jpeg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/51/UraMametchiGagCartoonist.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20221026234200","caption":"Ура Маметчи Гаг Карикатурист","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/51/UraMametchiGagCartoonist.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20221026234200"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:G3385559